<td data-mce-fragment="1">通常の本醸造より磨いた米を使って仕込み、すっきりとした飽きのこない飲み口に仕上げました。<br data-mce-fragment="1">奥深さが交差した切れが良い日本酒です。</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">濃醇</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">やや淡麗辛口</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">種類</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">特別本醸造</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">日本酒度</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">＋3.5</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">酸度</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">1.3</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">アミノ酸</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">1.6</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">アルコール度数</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">15度以上16度未満</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">酵母</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">701</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">原料米</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">五百万石</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">精米歩合</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">60%</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">原材料名</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1">米（国産）、米麹（国産米）、醸造アルコール</td>
</tr>
<tr data-mce-fragment="1">
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">内容量</strong></td>
<td data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1">720ml&nbsp;</span></td>
</tr>
